      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Iran has been attacking ship navigation systems on Didamar Island, Oman, and the damage caused is unknown.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-11:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:12Z",
      "text": "Since 1 March 2026, as part of the 2026 Iran war, Iran has been launching a series of drone and missile strikes on sites in Oman and its territorial waters.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385336272:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "On the map, the reports place it in the As Salamah Archipelago.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-11:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Wikipedia lists the conflict as ongoing.",
