      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:41Z",
      "text": "According to Wikipedia's sources, side 1 reports at least 19 drones intercepted, while side 2 reports one A-10 ground attack fighter jet destroyed and one pilot injured.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1385336272:casualties-side-1-",
        "wiki:box:1385336272:casualties-side-2-"
      ]
    },
    {
